# Fitrack - optional cloud sync (Supabase).
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the two values below. Leaving them
# UNSET is fully supported: the app runs local-first/offline exactly as before,
# builds without a Supabase project, and the Settings → Account section simply
# shows "Cloud sync not configured yet."
#
# Both values are public/browser-safe - the anon key is designed to ship to
# clients (row-level security, added in a later plan, is what protects data).
# Find them in your Supabase project under Settings → API.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
